From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: damnbitimcrit <333091414+damnbitimcrit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [Halo 3] Unlocked frame rate with render interpolation

For the disc release (default.xex hash 19EB90F06A070ED6):
- halo3_unlock_framerate skips the two vblank waits that hold the game at
  30 FPS and feeds the main loop's frame time from the host clock. The
  simulation converts real time into 30 Hz ticks, so game speed is
  unchanged. halo3_framerate_limit caps the frame rate.
- halo3_interpolation snapshots object node matrices and positions after
  every tick, draws a blend of the last two ticks weighted by the leftover
  tick fraction, and restores the real state before the next tick.
---
